WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.520
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:15.530
Four Star Academy's biggest event, the S4 Selection, is under way.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:20.700
All the students compete to become the top of their class and be in the next S4.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:26.790
In Dance Class, Yuzu-senpai blew the field away with a power that couldn't be touched.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.090
Her two consecutive S4 spots will go down in history!

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:35.930
Ako-chan tried her hardest in Theater Class, but she couldn't beat Tsubasa-senpai.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:42.020
Since Tsubasa-senpai is a third-year who'll be graduating, Ako-chan in second place will take the S4 spot.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:45.850
I think Ako-chan took it really hard though.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.280
Now, we're on the third day of the 
S4 Selection, with Beauty Class up.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:06.040
Mahiru-chan's battle is beginning.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:50.190
You've all heard of the devastatingly beautiful idol, Kasumi Yozora-san.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:54.400
She's the S4 member who leads 
Four Star Academy's Beauty Class.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:59.320
Next, we have the number one hyped rookie model, Kasumi Mahiru-san.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.410
Believe it or not, she's Yozora-san's younger sister.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:05.330
It's not often you see a pair of sisters both end up as models.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.120
Plus, they both have the skills to back it up.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:13.290
Today's Beauty Class S4 Selection is being billed as a one-on-one fight between the two.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:17.460
Which of the sisters will emerge victorious? Only time will tell.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.050
Who's it gonna be?

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.430
I think it'll be Yozora-senpai.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.550
But Mahiru-chan's been shooting up the ranks.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.430
She has countless fans by now.

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:31.060
The entire school's been buzzing with Yozora-senpai and Mahiru-chan.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.440
It's not just here.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:36.940
The "Battle of the Sisters" is the cover story this issue.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.570
It's really getting hyped up.

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:41.450
Was that not to be expected?

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.280
Ako-chan.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:46.950
This is the first time sisters have competed since the founding of Four Star Academy.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.330
It's only natural they're receiving all this attention.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:55.590
So um, are you okay?

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.210
What do you mean?

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.130
After yesterday...

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.970
Do you mean to imply that I would be depressed after losing?

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.380
You're not?

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:07.350
Even if I was, hypothetically, I would have gotten over it yesterday.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:12.730
I have no time to wallow in self-pity, 
as my induction into S4 is fast approaching.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.730
Ako-chan.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.230
More importantly, today's competition carries far more weight.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.110
Huh? In what way?

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:24.160
Dance Class had Yuzu-senpai, 
and Theater Class had Tsubasa-senpai.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:27.620
The reigning S4 members have gone undefeated so far.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:34.000
At this rate, we'll be viewed as an incompetent S4 who got 
handed the positions only due to our predecessors' graduation.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.250
That wouldn't get me going!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.460
And it is exactly why Mahiru must win.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.590
She will.

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:46.140
Mahiru-chan has been training for the sole purpose of surpassing Yozora-senpai.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:59.270
Reading Mahiru's Stylish Girl Lesson?

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:02.690
That page has garnered a huge following.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:09.660
I know! Everyone loves how she teaches girls who have trouble with fashion small tricks to enjoy being stylish.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:15.670
Mahiru may have a bit of a serious streak, 
but deep down she's a thoughtful and kind girl.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:18.880
I can feel Mahiru's essence on each of these pages. {volume 18? it must be a weekly magazine}

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.820
Mahiru-chan is probably getting in the zone.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.480
You think she's breaking tiles?

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.700
Ossu!

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.160
Likely more than we can imagine.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.450
Tiles are a given...

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.760
But maybe she got overenthusiastic and split the Earth!

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.510
No way, no way.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.890
Yes, come in.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.430
Sorry to disturb you.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.640
We brought you a snack.

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.270
Thanks.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.900
Huh? You're not smashing tiles?

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:05.270
I already did. I went through them all last night.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.530
All prepped and ready?

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:11.530
Yeah, I've done everything I could.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.240
Now I just have to wait until my turn.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.450
That's good, then. You'll be fine.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.250
Is that Aikatsu Style Girls? {I didn't realize this overlapped with stylish girl lesson}

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.040
Yes.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:28.050
She's arranged traditional wear from around the world in her own way, and even integrated the newest accessories.{garb, clothes}

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:33.430
I've only come to fully appreciate it since entering Four Star Academy and starting my Aikatsu.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.810
Kasumi Yozora is worthy of respect.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:41.060
Hey, Mahiru! Don't you dare say you've already given up on defeating her.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.770
I've been anticipating this day for my entire life.{but I waaaanna}

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.690
My goal of surpassing my sister has never changed.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.610
I swear I won't lose!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:55.200
It is time to open the S4 Selection for Beauty Class!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:08:01.460
Final scores will be derived from judges' evaluations of a model walking segment and a live performance.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:05.080
Let's welcome the first in our lineup!

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:21.850
Next is the highly anticipated Kasumi Mahiru!

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.070
Mahiru-neesan!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.740
This is crazy!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.870
What a tremendous reception.

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:37.240
She's great!

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.000
Mahiru-chan is beautiful.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:50.000
Finishing us off is Beauty Class's current S4 rep, Kasumi Yozora!

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.030
Yozora-sama!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.360
What was that just now?

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:17.530
The instant Yozora-senpai stepped up, 
the entire atmosphere changed.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.530
This is the power of S4.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.290
I've been awaiting this day, Kasumi Yozora.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:29.040
As have I, Kasumi Mahiru.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.500
Let's fight with everything we have.

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.800
Of course. I'd accept nothing less.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:40.800
So this is the first sister face-off 
Four Star Academy's ever seen.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.310
What do you predict will happen?

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:47.730
According to my analysis, their fan support and abilities are evenly matched.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:51.190
I suppose Kasumi Yozora has the slightest advantage due to her experience.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:54.940
No, you never know how competitions will turn out until they happen.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.200
Asahi-kun?

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:06.080
I want Nee-san to win, but I also want Mahiru to win. I'd like to cheer for both of them...

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:12.090
It doesn't matter whether they're friends or sisters—
there will be a loser. That's how the world of pros works.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:15.340
I know that! I know, but...

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.340
Whoever loses will be hurt.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:21.010
Either way, it won't be easy to take.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.200
Now, where does that place Momoi Kokoro?

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:44.540
Oh! She's topped the current rankings!

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.870
Mahiru's finally coming up.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:05.220
Kasumi Mahiru, like a radiant light!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.950
What a mysterious feeling.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:19.040
It's as if seeing Mahiru's performance could inspire even the most downtrodden person to stand up again.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:19.960
Yeah.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.340
Now for her results.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.720
Kasumi Mahiru tops the ranking!

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:38.940
And now, all that's left is the finale.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.480
Onee-chan.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.310
Kasumi Yozora!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:49.400
Kasumi Yozora, like a glimmering star!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:23.480
That was stunning. She really is the top of Beauty Class.

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.560
But Mahiru didn't give any ground.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.940
Let's view the final judgement.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.830
The top is Kasumi Mahiru!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.460
Yes!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.470
No...

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.470
You did it, Mahiru-chan!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.090
Bravo.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:06.350
Mahiru-chan?

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:09.020
Congratulations, Mahiru.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.860
Wasn't your goal to defeat Onee-chan?

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:16.860
All your hard work paid off, 
so at least look a little happy.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:20.950
I'm really happy for you.

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:25.870
Thank you for surpassing me!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.750
With this, I can leave unburdened. {unburdened}{I know you meant replace light with unburdened but}{actually no, you got it}

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.260
Everyone.

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:43.140
I would like to make an announcement.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:46.390
After my graduation from Four Star Academy,

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.480
I will leaving to study in France.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:56.900
In France, the capital of fashion, 
I plan to learn and expand my horizons.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:00.410
We must say goodbye for a while.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.830
Say it isn't true!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.290
Yozora-chan, don't go!

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:09.540
Yozora-chan!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.540
Don't quit!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:17.130
Kasumi Yozora is someone constantly aspiring to improve herself!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:24.720
She's hardworking, ambitious, and not satisfied simply by being on top.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:29.180
She forges a new path on her way to a higher stage.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.690
That's the kind of person my sister is!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.690
Mahiru?

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.860
I already knew from chasing after you for so long.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:43.660
That once you finished your duty in S4, 
you would set off on a journey.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.490
That we would have to part...

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:49.660
All I could do...

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.130
You'll be just fine, even without me.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:20:00.590
No matter what obstacles you face, you don't give in and forge on with all your strength.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.970
You're hardworking, ambitious, and diligent.

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:07.220
That's Kasumi Mahiru.

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.520
My little sister who I couldn't be more proud of.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:13.980
Onee-chan...

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.690
I have one last request for you.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:28.740
I want you to inherit the brand I raised, Romance Kiss.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.750
Will you accept it?

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:43.260
My dream wouldn't exist without you.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:47.220
At first, I wanted to follow in your footsteps.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:53.890
But at some point, I started to see a different kind of idol emerge, and devoted myself to embracing that.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:59.690
The whole reason I've come this far is because of you!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:02.610
Kasumi Yozora is my inspiration!

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:05.910
You always have been, and you always will be!

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.200
Mahiru...

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:12.040
Thank you, Onee-chan!

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.460
That was a battle for the ages.

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.800
What a display of sisterly love!

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:26.010
Headmaster, there's no need to cry.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:27.680
I'm not crying!

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:36.190
These emotions are tearing me apart! 
I'm so glad I was born!

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:39.190
Thank god I was born a Kasumi!

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.650
Kasumis, bravo!

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:46.200
Yozora-san and Mahiru-chan are the best!

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:56.210
Don't let your guard down in France.

00:21:56.670 --> 00:22:00.960
My eternal goal is to defeat Onee-chan, got it?

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.090
Yes, I wouldn't want it any other way!

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:19.310
<i>The final day has come.</i>

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:23.650
<i>The battle for Song Class is about to begin.</i>

00:24:11.010 --> 00:24:12.930
The order for Song Class has been decided.

00:24:13.390 --> 00:24:16.350
It is time to fulfill my promise with Yuzu.

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:17.970
I won't lose to anyone!

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:20.680
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:22.310
A Song That's Mine.

00:24:22.310 --> 00:24:24.400
Become the first-star idol!
